ked on without shared state or sequential dependencies", SourcePath:"~/.claude/skills/dispatching-parallel-agents", Provider:"claude", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:true, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"domain-modeling", Name:"domain-modeling", Description:"Build and sharpen a project's domain model. Use when discussing codebase terminology, writing or editing a CONTEXT.md, or recording or editing an ADR.", SourcePath:"~/.claude/skills/domain-modeling", Provider:"claude", Root:"provider", Plugin:"", CanDisable:true, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"earnings-reviewer:audit-xls", Name:"earnings-reviewer:audit-xls", Description:"Audit a spreadsheet for formula accuracy, errors, and common mistakes. Scopes to a selected range, a single sheet, or the entire model (including financial-model integrity checks like BS balance, cash tie-out, and logic sanity). Triggers on \"audit this sheet\", \"check my formulas\", \"find formula errors\", \"QA this spreadsheet\", \"sanity check this\", \"debug model\", \"model check\", \"model won't balance\", \"something's off in my model\", \"model review\".", SourcePath:"~/.claude/plugins/cache/claude-for-financial-services/earnings-reviewer/0.1.1/skills/audit-xls", Provider:"claude", Root:"plugin", Plugin:"earnings-reviewer@claude-for-financial-services", CanDisable:true, FileCount:1}, daemon.runtimeLocalSkillSummary{Key:"earnings-reviewer:earnings-analysis", Name:"earnings-reviewer:earnings-analysis", Description:"Create professional equity research earnings update reports (8-12 pages, 3,000-5,000 words) analyzing quarterly results for companies already under coverage. Fast-turnaround format focusing on beat/miss analysis, key metrics, updated estimates, and revised thesis. Includes 1-3 summary tables and 8-12 charts. Use when user requests \"earnings update\", \"quarterly update\", \"earnings analysis\", \"Q1/Q2/Q3/Q4 results\", or post-earnings report.", SourcePath:"~/.claude/plugins/cach