niversal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:3} {Key:stitch-design-taste Name:stitch-design-taste Description:Semantic Design System Skill for Google Stitch. Generates agent-friendly DESIGN.md files that enforce premium, anti-generic UI standards — strict typography, calibrated color, asymmetric layouts, perpetual micro-motion, and hardware-accelerated performance. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/stitch-design-taste Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:system-prompts Name:system-prompts Description:Write system prompts, tool docs, and agent definitions. Project tag conventions + RFC 2119 keywords + dense compression. Use when authoring or editing any prompt the model reads. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/system-prompts Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:systematic-debugging Name:systematic-debugging Description:Use when encountering any bug, test failure, or unexpected behavior, before proposing fixes SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/systematic-debugging Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:11} {Key:tavily-search Name:tavily-search Description:Search the web with LLM-optimized results via the Tavily CLI. Use this skill when the user wants to search the web, find articles, look up information, get recent news, discover sources, or says "search for", "find me", "look up", "what's the latest on", "find articles about", or needs current information from the internet. Returns relevant results with content snippets, relevance scores, and metadata — optimized for LLM consumption. Supports domain filtering, time ranges, and multiple search depths. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/tavily-search Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:1} {Key:tdd Name:tdd Description:Test-driven development. Use when the user wants to build features or fix bugs test-first, mentions "red-green-refactor", or wants integration tests. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/tdd Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:4} {Key:teach Name:teach Description:Teach the user a new skill or concept, within this workspace. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/teach Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:6} {Key:to-questionnaire Name:to-questionnaire Description:Turn a decision you can't fully answer into a questionnaire for someone else to fill in. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/to-questionnaire Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:to-spec Name:to-spec Description:Turn the current conversation into a spec and publish it to the project issue tracker: no interview, just synthesis of what you've already discussed. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/to-spec Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:to-tickets Name:to-tickets Description:Break a plan, spec, or the current conversation into a set of tracer-bullet tickets, each declaring its blocking edges, published to the configured tracker (edges as text in one file per ticket locally, or native blocking links on a real tracker). SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/to-tickets Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:triage Name:triage Description:Move issues and external PRs through a state machine of triage roles, categorise, verify, grill if needed, and write agent-ready briefs. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/triage Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:4} {Key:wait-what Name:wait-what Description:Stop. That last message did not land: re-pitch it. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/wait-what Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:wayfinder Name:wayfinder Description:Plan a huge chunk of work (more than one agent session can hold) as a shared map of decision tickets on your issue tracker, and resolve them one at a time until the way to the destination is clear. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/wayfinder Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:wizard Name:wizard Description:Generate an interactive bash wizard that walks a human through steps only they can perform. Use when provisioning infrastructure, setting up credentials or CI secrets, walking an unfamiliar third-party dashboard, or running a one-off migration or cutover. Don't invoke this for steps the agent can perform itself. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/wizard Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:3} {Key:writing-beats Name:writing-beats Description:Writing, exploit; assemble raw material into a journey of beats, grounding each term before a beat leans on it. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/writing-beats Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:writing-for-agents Name:writing-for-agents Description:Writing documents for agents. Use when creating or editing skills, or modifying AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/writing-for-agents Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:3} {Key:writing-fragments Name:writing-fragments Description:Writing, explore: mine raw fragments, no structure yet. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/writing-fragments Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:writing-plans Name:writing-plans Description:Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/writing-plans Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2} {Key:writing-shape Name:writing-shape Description:Writing, exploit: shape raw material into an article, paragraph by paragraph. SourcePath:~/.agents/skills/writing-shape Provider:grok Root:universal Plugin: CanDisable:false FileCount:2}]
